---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { t, type Lang } from '../../i18n/ui';

interface Props { lang: Lang }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === 'en';
---

<Base
  title={isEn ? 'Atlas of Collections' : '收藏星图'}
  description={isEn
    ? 'My 800+ bookmarks across three platforms, grown into a living Renaissance star atlas.'
    : '把我在三个平台的 800+ 条收藏，种成一张活的文艺复兴星图。'}
  lang={lang}
>
  <article class="story">
    <header class="story-hero" data-fade>
      <p class="story-eyebrow">Interactive · 2026</p>
      <h1 class="story-title">{isEn ? 'Atlas of Collections' : '收藏星图'}</h1>
      <p class="story-sub">{isEn
        ? 'Every bookmark a star, every obsession a constellation.'
        : '每条收藏是一颗星，每段痴迷是一个星座。'}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="story-body">
      <figure class="story-figure">
        <a href="/atlas/" aria-label={isEn ? 'Enter the interactive Atlas of Collections' : '进入收藏星图互动场景'}>
          <img
            src="/projects/atlas/card.jpg"
            alt={isEn ? 'A brass armillary sphere floating in mist, surrounded by nine constellations' : '雾气中的黄铜天球仪，九个星座环绕'}
            loading="eager"
          />
        </a>
      </figure>

      {isEn ? (
        <>
          <p>
            My bookmarks are the most honest record of who I was: 241 posts on Jike, 272 notes on Xiaohongshu, 384 videos on Bilibili. So I pulled them all out, read every single one, and grew them into a star atlas — a brass armillary turning slowly in the mist, nine constellations around it, one star per bookmark.
          </p>
          <p>
            Drag to look around; brush the mist aside with your cursor; hover a star to see what it holds, and click to visit the original post. The soundscape is synthesized live — no audio files at all.
          </p>
          <p>
            <a class="story-link" href="/atlas/">Enter the atlas →</a>
          </p>
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          <p>
            收藏夹是一个人最诚实的数字足迹：即刻 241 条、小红书 272 条、B 站 384 个视频。我把它们全部取了出来，逐条读完，种成了一张星图——黄铜天球仪在雾气里缓缓转动，九个星座环绕，每条收藏都是一颗星。
          </p>
          <p>
            拖动环视，鼠标拂过雾气会散开；悬停星星能看见它藏着什么，点击直达原帖。环境音是实时合成的，整个页面没有加载任何音频文件。
          </p>
          <p>
            <a class="story-link" href="/atlas/">入境 →</a>
          </p>
        </>
      )}
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .story {
    padding: 0 96px 160px;
  }

  .story-hero {
    max-width: 768px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 160px 0 72px;
  }

  .story-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.28px;
    color: #707070;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .story-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 60px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 72px;
    letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 60px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 72px;
    letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    color: #707070;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-body {
    max-width: 768px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .story-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 42px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-body p + p {
    margin-top: 1.5em;
  }

  .story-figure {
    margin: 48px 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .story-figure:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .story-figure img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    transition: opacity 200ms;
  }

  .story-figure a:hover img {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .story-link {
    color: #000;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 6px;
    transition: color 200ms;
  }

  .story-link:hover {
    color: #707070;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .story {
      padding: 0 24px 80px;
    }

    .story-hero {
      padding: 120px 0 56px;
    }

    .story-title,
    .story-sub {
      font-size: 36px;
      line-height: 44px;
      letter-spacing: -0.72px;
    }

    .story-body p {
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 33px;
    }

    .story-figure {
      margin: 40px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
